WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.001
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.002
"This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:04.003
We hope you're all doing well

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:05.004
and, now, if you don't mind,

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:06.005
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:07.506
Senate Democrats this week

00:00:07.506 --> 00:00:09.375
introduced a new bill proposing

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:12.044
a so-called
billionaires income tax,

00:00:12.044 --> 00:00:14.748
while Senate Republicans
introduced a new bill proposing

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:16.883
you can claim your yacht
as a dependent.

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:18.584
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.584 --> 00:00:21.587
In a recent interview,
singer Olivia Rodrigo said that,

00:00:21.587 --> 00:00:23.890
when she went to the
White House earlier this year,

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:27.259
President Biden gave her
a pair of sunglasses, M&amp;M's,

00:00:27.259 --> 00:00:29.496
and a shoehorn
with the president seal,

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:31.797
which is definitely
just some stuff

00:00:31.797 --> 00:00:33.766
that was on his desk
when she showed up.

00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:35.201
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:37.203
[ As Biden ]
You, uh, you wear shoes, right?

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:39.471
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.471 --> 00:00:40.740
The House voted today

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:44.443
on the Protect Older
Job Applicants Act of 2021,

00:00:44.443 --> 00:00:47.413
I assume, to get ready
for the 2024 election.

00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:50.083
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:51.384
[ Fresh laughter ]

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:53.352
President Biden today unveiled
a revised framework

00:00:53.352 --> 00:00:55.488
for his domestic spending plan,
which includes more

00:00:55.488 --> 00:00:58.290
than $555 billion
for clean energy.

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:01.527
Even Joe Manchin says
he supports that $400 billion.

00:01:01.527 --> 00:01:03.863
He only hopes that they'll find
a responsible way to use

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:05.298
that $310 billion.

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:07.267
[ Laughter ]
After all, $120 billion

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:09.235
is a lot of money
and nobody wants to waste

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:10.470
that $42 billion.

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:11.538
[ Laughter ]
He then added, "Hey,

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:12.839
how about zero?"

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:14.440
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:16.443
President Biden met today
with House Democrats

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:18.511
to discuss his healthcare
spending proposal

00:01:18.511 --> 00:01:20.847
on the infrastructure bill,
which is now down

00:01:20.847 --> 00:01:23.716
to a 30-day trial for WebMD+

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:25.785
and they're going to paint
some tunnels on a rock,

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:26.953
like Wile E. Coyote.

00:01:26.953 --> 00:01:28.788
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:30.523
With more and more policies
being cut

00:01:30.523 --> 00:01:33.125
from President Biden's Build
Back better spending bill,

00:01:33.125 --> 00:01:36.028
including guaranteed paid leave,
tax hikes on the wealthy,

00:01:36.028 --> 00:01:38.397
and several other policies
that the president promised,

00:01:38.397 --> 00:01:40.633
many are wonder what's left
in the bill,

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:42.768
so we thought we'd give you
a quick rundown

00:01:42.768 --> 00:01:45.437
of what's actually left
in Build Back Better.

00:01:45.437 --> 00:01:48.541
[ Jaunty tune plays ]

00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:49.609
This song again?

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:52.579
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.447 --> 00:01:56.850 line:0%
[ Laughter and cheering ]

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:01.688 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.091 --> 00:02:07.127 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.597 --> 00:02:11.965 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:16.769 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.273 --> 00:02:21.374 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:25.545 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:28.815 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:34.387 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.922 --> 00:02:37.123 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:39.926 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.403 --> 00:02:51.604 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.207 --> 00:02:55.308 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:00.713 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.749 --> 00:03:04.017 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.686 --> 00:03:08.788 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
And, finally...

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:13.593
This has been "What Actually
Is Left in Build Back Better."

00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:16.663
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

00:03:18.897 --> 00:03:21.167
Ahead of President Biden's
meeting with Pope Francis,

00:03:21.167 --> 00:03:23.669
White House Press Secretary
Jen Psaki said yesterday

00:03:23.669 --> 00:03:26.872
that she does not expect the two
to discuss abortion.

00:03:26.872 --> 00:03:28.073
Wow!

00:03:28.073 --> 00:03:29.442
So they're keeping it.

00:03:29.442 --> 00:03:32.945
[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.945 --> 00:03:34.113
[ Mouths "Wow!" ]

00:03:36.416 --> 00:03:39.952
According to a new survey,
19% of Americans said they rely

00:03:39.952 --> 00:03:41.754
on their body's internal clock

00:03:41.754 --> 00:03:43.455
to wake them up
at a certain time.

00:03:43.455 --> 00:03:45.057
Oh, yeah, there's a term
for those people.

00:03:45.057 --> 00:03:46.058
What is it again?

00:03:46.058 --> 00:03:47.694
Oh, yeah, late.

00:03:47.694 --> 00:03:49.094
[ Laughter ]

00:03:49.094 --> 00:03:51.397
Apple released
an iPhone update this week

00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:54.500
that allows users to add
their coronavirus vaccine card

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.135
to the Wallet app
and guess what.

00:03:56.135 --> 00:03:57.770
It doesn't fit there, either.

00:03:57.770 --> 00:04:00.506
[ Laughter ]

00:04:00.506 --> 00:04:02.307
And, finally,
five men in New York

00:04:02.307 --> 00:04:03.375
were charged yesterday

00:04:03.375 --> 00:04:05.077
with operating a narcotics ring

00:04:05.077 --> 00:04:06.211
that allegedly smuggled

00:04:06.211 --> 00:04:08.614
millions of dollars' worth
of cocaine hidden

00:04:08.614 --> 00:04:10.049
in children's lunchboxes.

00:04:10.049 --> 00:04:12.251
Still healthier than Lunchables.

00:04:12.251 --> 00:04:14.554
[ Laughter ]
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

